    "description": "Cumulative credits issued vs refunded per subject, derived from pendingbot.pnc_ledger (the integer shadow ledger). NOTE: real-time wallet balances live in Polar / WalletDO, NOT in Postgres \u2014 Postgres only has the issue/refund shadow rows. The 'net' figures here = cumulative credits in (topup/admin/redemption) minus refunds; they are NOT live balances (consumption is debited in Polar/WalletDO and audit_log, not pnc_ledger). PNC = delta_pnc_micros / 1e6.",
