        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "**Real-time wallet balance lives in Polar / WalletDO, not in Postgres.** This dashboard shows the *cumulative credits issued \u2212 refunded* shadow ledger (`pendingbot.pnc_ledger`) as a rough proxy. Consumption is debited in Polar/WalletDO + recorded in `audit_log`, so a subject's live balance is NOT issued \u2212 refunded here. For authoritative balances, query Polar."
        }
      },
